 "brief": {
  "text": "Key Message: Wedding filmmakers shouldn't have to spend countless hours editing instead of doing what they love. Bride&Groom.video helps videographers eliminate editing backlogs, reclaim their time, deliver films faster, and grow their businesses without compromising their creative style.\nFormat: Instagram carousel, 6 slides, 1080 × 1350 px (4:5).\nSlide Content:\n\n1. Cover: 5 Signs It's Time to Outsource Your Wedding Editing\n2. Sign #1: Your editing backlog keeps growing. You're booking new weddings while still editing last month's footage.\n3. Sign #2: You're spending more time editing than filming. You became a filmmaker to create, not to spend every evening behind a computer.\n4. Sign #3: Your turnaround times are getting longer. Keeping clients waiting shouldn't be part of your workflow.\n5. Sign #4: You're turning down new opportunities. When editing consumes your schedule, there's little room left to grow.\n6. CTA: You shoot. We edit. You grow. Let Bride&Groom.video handle your post-production so you can focus on what you love.\n\nCall to Action: Ready to get your time back? Visit bridengroom.video to explore our editing services.\n",
  "topic": "Signs it is time to outsource wedding video editing",
  "keyMessage": "Bride&Groom.video helps videographers eliminate editing backlogs and reclaim their time",
